WEBVTT

00:10.530 --> 00:11.500
Sei.

00:12.340 --> 00:14.800
Sei? We're here.

00:15.750 --> 00:18.290
It's time to wake up. Open your eyes.

00:30.830 --> 00:31.970
Sei...

00:33.120 --> 00:34.160
Sei?

00:34.510 --> 00:36.740
Sei! We're here.

00:40.660 --> 00:42.640
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:42.640 --> 00:44.570
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:44.570 --> 00:47.030
Totally fine. Sorry.

00:53.070 --> 00:56.020
<i>What in the world am I dreaming about?</i>

01:10.670 --> 01:12.220
Oscar?

01:12.500 --> 01:15.170
Welcome to Morgenhaffen!

02:51.730 --> 02:54.520
What are you doing here, Oscar?

02:54.520 --> 02:57.040
I had some business in town.

02:57.040 --> 03:00.530
I couldn't pass up coming to greet you
when I found out you were coming.

03:00.530 --> 03:02.330
You really didn't have to.

03:02.610 --> 03:04.100
Of course I did.

03:04.100 --> 03:06.540
Our business is nothing without you, Lady Sei.

03:17.630 --> 03:20.390
Wow, this is amazing!

03:24.700 --> 03:27.620
A boat just arrived at the port.

03:28.810 --> 03:33.640
You might find what you're looking for 
at tomorrow's morning market, Lady Sei.

03:34.360 --> 03:37.640
It'll be dark soon, 
and the market starts bright and early.

03:37.640 --> 03:40.070
We should head to the inn and rest up.

03:40.740 --> 03:41.780
Huh?

03:41.780 --> 03:44.750
I'm staying at the same inn you'll be using.

03:47.460 --> 03:49.100
Now then, let's go.

03:51.590 --> 03:54.590
"A Foreign Country"

04:03.220 --> 04:05.440
Sei! Are you ready?

04:05.440 --> 04:06.900
Everyone's waiting.

04:06.900 --> 04:08.940
Yes! I'm coming!

04:18.780 --> 04:21.030
D-Do I look strange?

04:22.160 --> 04:23.490
Not at all.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.520
You look like a merchant's daughter

04:27.520 --> 04:30.130
sneaking out in disguise to go explore.

04:30.130 --> 04:32.040
I'm sure the director would be relieved.

04:32.040 --> 04:34.170
Ah, the director...

04:39.180 --> 04:41.180
I've been taking it easy lately.

04:41.180 --> 04:44.110
You aren't resting at all, are you?

04:44.110 --> 04:48.200
You even work on your hobby 
research on your days off.

04:48.200 --> 04:50.080
Is that how you see it?

04:50.080 --> 04:51.380
I certainly do.

04:51.380 --> 04:55.130
So you're going to Morgenhaffen. 
Use this trip to relax.

04:56.090 --> 04:59.150
Oh, and take this with you.

05:02.370 --> 05:03.460
What's this?

05:04.060 --> 05:07.090
You're going incognito.
You'll wear a disguise.

05:07.090 --> 05:08.740
Don't forget you're the Saint.

05:08.740 --> 05:09.740
What?

05:09.740 --> 05:12.760
I'll have the Third Order
send guards with you,

05:12.760 --> 05:14.550
but it won't hurt to play it safe.

05:15.990 --> 05:17.060
I'm sorry.

05:17.060 --> 05:20.220
I wanted to come and protect you myself...

05:20.220 --> 05:22.680
Yeah, there's no way <i>you</i> can go incognito.

05:22.680 --> 05:24.630
Even so, I...

05:25.890 --> 05:27.350
No. Absolutely no way.

05:27.350 --> 05:28.650
But...

05:28.650 --> 05:31.330
It's impossible. You stand out way too much.

05:31.330 --> 05:34.180
I could put on a disguise like Sei!

05:34.180 --> 05:35.730
Nope. Not happening.

05:34.530 --> 05:36.570
I can't wait to see Morgenhaffen!

05:36.570 --> 05:38.530
Oh? You're going too?

05:38.530 --> 05:42.240
Yeah. I'm interested in 
the wares of foreign countries.

05:42.570 --> 05:44.700
I'd expect no less from a merchant's son.

05:44.700 --> 05:46.060
Fair enough.

05:46.060 --> 05:51.810
Come to think of it, it'd be best if you act
like you're from a merchant family too.

05:51.810 --> 05:53.510
I see...

05:57.440 --> 05:58.610
What do you think?

05:58.610 --> 06:01.010
Do I look like a merchant's daughter?

06:02.080 --> 06:04.630
Let's go with that. What do you think?

06:05.550 --> 06:07.320
It's lovely.

06:07.700 --> 06:12.070
While you have a different air about you,
 you still look beautiful.

06:13.890 --> 06:15.850
Thank you very much...

06:16.700 --> 06:20.440
Even in disguise, you're striking.
Be careful.

06:20.440 --> 06:23.000
N-No, that's not true...

06:24.640 --> 06:30.410
I'm sure I'd be able to find you immediately,
no matter what disguise you might wear.

06:37.460 --> 06:40.580
<i>That smile does a number on my poor heart...</i>

06:59.690 --> 07:01.150
Hey, Sei!

07:01.150 --> 07:03.650
Don't wander off like that.

07:04.580 --> 07:05.920
Sorry, sorry.

07:05.920 --> 07:08.370
There's so much here, I can't help myself.

07:08.710 --> 07:11.540
You can't help yourself? Jeez, come on...

07:22.250 --> 07:23.710
Has something happened?

07:23.710 --> 07:26.080
There was an accident at the dock.

07:26.080 --> 07:29.900
Some cargo toppled over 
and crushed someone beneath it.

07:29.900 --> 07:31.780
That's terrible...

07:31.780 --> 07:33.430
Let's head over there!

07:35.170 --> 07:36.730
What was that about?

07:36.730 --> 07:38.130
Someone's been injured?

07:40.180 --> 07:41.630
H-Hey, Sei!

07:53.580 --> 07:54.860
Anyone!

07:54.860 --> 07:57.790
Is there anyone here 
who can cast healing magic?!

07:58.200 --> 08:00.890
The potions we have on hand 
aren't strong enough to save him!

08:09.990 --> 08:13.140
Do any of you know someone 
who can cast healing magic?!

08:13.140 --> 08:15.820
No one can heal an injury that grave...

08:15.820 --> 08:16.820
How unfortunate...

08:16.820 --> 08:19.410
Even if someone <i>could</i> heal that,
they wouldn't be here.

08:19.410 --> 08:21.730
Only the royal palace might...

08:30.640 --> 08:33.520
Sei, I know what you're thinking, but...

08:35.650 --> 08:37.330
I agree with Jude.

08:37.780 --> 08:39.260
Wolff...

08:39.260 --> 08:41.330
It'd be dangerous to cause a scene.

08:41.330 --> 08:45.320
As your bodyguard, 
I strongly suggest not intervening.

08:45.990 --> 08:48.260
Yes, you're right...

08:48.510 --> 08:49.970
I'm sorry.

09:11.110 --> 09:12.100
Um!

09:12.100 --> 09:12.910
Huh?!

09:12.910 --> 09:14.120
Excuse me!

09:15.120 --> 09:19.830
This might sound like a silly question,
but did you try mid-grade potions on him?

09:19.830 --> 09:22.590
Y-Yes, we did.

09:31.340 --> 09:32.880
What's this?

09:32.880 --> 09:36.850
Something I carry with me 
for emergencies. Please take it.

09:36.850 --> 09:39.560
But he's already beyond potions...

09:47.440 --> 09:51.150
I hope it'll be of some use to you.

09:56.790 --> 09:57.780
Thank you.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.920
Sei...

10:09.920 --> 10:12.290
I didn't use any magic.

10:12.290 --> 10:14.690
So just let me have this.

10:25.690 --> 10:31.060
<i>Since I couldn't cast magic,
that was the least I could do...</i>

10:35.760 --> 10:37.410
That's not the problem.

10:38.200 --> 10:40.680
You made that potion, didn't you?

10:40.680 --> 10:43.040
It'll be strong enough to raise suspicion.

10:45.870 --> 10:49.260
If anyone asks, I'll just say 
it was a gift from someone.

10:49.260 --> 10:51.340
That'll work, right?

10:51.340 --> 10:53.130
Really?

11:05.620 --> 11:06.690
Hello.

11:07.110 --> 11:09.340
Did you find what you were looking for?

11:09.750 --> 11:12.680
No, I got too preoccupied 
with something else...

11:12.680 --> 11:14.650
I'll go out again tomorrow.

11:16.090 --> 11:17.710
What happened?

11:17.710 --> 11:19.550
So, actually...

11:19.550 --> 11:20.870
Captain!

11:25.040 --> 11:26.600
I finally found you!

11:31.720 --> 11:34.090
Do you have some business with the lady?

11:34.390 --> 11:36.910
Pardon me. My name is Ceyran.

11:36.910 --> 11:40.550
I'm the captain of a trade ship 
from the Empire of Zaidera.

11:40.550 --> 11:42.070
Do you know this man?

11:42.070 --> 11:45.390
Well, you see, some things happened...

11:45.390 --> 11:48.850
Yeah, um, to tell you the truth, uh...

11:53.070 --> 11:55.830
My crewman is still alive thanks to you.

11:55.830 --> 11:59.070
I wanted to express my gratitude. Thank you.

11:59.070 --> 12:01.280
I'm glad it proved useful.

12:01.280 --> 12:05.050
Please allow me to pay for that potion.

12:05.050 --> 12:10.990
Erm, I received it as a gift, 
so I can't say how much it cost...

12:10.990 --> 12:14.900
It had such a miraculous effect. 
I can't accept it for free.

12:14.900 --> 12:16.840
You don't need to worry about that.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.260
My conscience won't allow it.

12:18.260 --> 12:20.470
No, really, think nothing of it!

12:20.470 --> 12:21.930
But I can't do that...

12:22.260 --> 12:24.140
It's seriously okay!

12:28.960 --> 12:30.940
Well, what about this?

12:31.730 --> 12:34.990
Why not show her your wares 
and discount anything

12:34.990 --> 12:36.900
she wishes to purchase?

12:40.070 --> 12:42.530
Would that really be enough?

12:43.050 --> 12:44.490
Of course!

12:53.570 --> 12:57.680
Um, what are Zaidera's specialty goods?

12:57.680 --> 13:02.640
Well, we didn't bring much 
because they're not very popular here, but...

13:05.360 --> 13:06.810
Sansho pepper!

13:06.810 --> 13:08.270
Chili peppers!

13:08.270 --> 13:09.980
Star anise!

13:09.980 --> 13:13.480
Wow. You know your stuff, young lady.

13:13.480 --> 13:16.530
We don't sell much of this 
outside of the country.

13:20.230 --> 13:23.010
In that case, do you recognize this?

13:31.230 --> 13:32.290
Miso?

13:32.800 --> 13:34.300
Is this miso?!

13:34.300 --> 13:36.980
That's amazing. You even know what that is...

13:36.980 --> 13:39.260
What else? What else do you have?!

13:39.260 --> 13:41.720
W-Well, we have other things in the back...

14:07.620 --> 14:10.290
Could it be... 
Could this be what I think it is?!

14:12.250 --> 14:14.150
Rice!

14:52.660 --> 14:53.910
What's that?

14:56.380 --> 14:59.150
O-Oh, this was a gift from Sei...

14:59.150 --> 15:02.710
It's a seasoning from our homeland.

15:04.180 --> 15:06.180
Something from Lady Sei's homeland?

15:06.180 --> 15:09.960
She's going to treat me to food 
made with these ingredients!

15:09.960 --> 15:13.640
She asked me to invite both of you as well.

15:14.190 --> 15:15.850
I don't mind going.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.820
However, you...

15:22.970 --> 15:24.690
What are you doing?

15:24.690 --> 15:26.270
Let's get going already.

15:38.910 --> 15:40.490
Are you finally going to make it?

15:40.490 --> 15:41.510
I am!

15:48.480 --> 15:50.650
It's still going to be a while yet.

15:50.650 --> 15:51.720
Is that so?

15:51.720 --> 15:52.870
Yup.

15:52.870 --> 15:55.930
Rice needs to soak after being washed.

15:56.500 --> 15:59.300
I'll be making a lot of dishes to go with it.

16:03.150 --> 16:05.610
So I'll call you when it's ready.

16:06.580 --> 16:08.200
I see...

16:32.530 --> 16:33.880
You're here!

16:36.690 --> 16:38.660
Oh, it's just you.

16:39.200 --> 16:40.900
So, what do you need?

16:40.900 --> 16:45.570
The bodyguards that went 
to Morgenhaffen finished their reports.

16:45.570 --> 16:47.300
I came to deliver them.

16:47.300 --> 16:49.300
Oh?

16:50.250 --> 16:52.170
Reports...

16:52.800 --> 16:54.920
Reports, huh?

16:56.670 --> 17:00.670
Well, they're not the only reason I came...

17:08.130 --> 17:11.890
I see. Sei sent you an invitation.

17:12.340 --> 17:16.060
Yes. It was a very modest one.

17:17.140 --> 17:18.770
I can imagine.

17:19.320 --> 17:23.070
Though the two of you 
can't be so modest forever.

17:23.940 --> 17:27.950
She's made quite a name for herself by
going out on all those subjugation missions.

17:27.950 --> 17:30.810
Care to guess what will come next?

17:30.810 --> 17:32.880
What comes next, huh...?

17:39.290 --> 17:43.470
Well, I know that Sei hasn't even 
thought about getting engaged.

17:43.470 --> 17:45.730
All she thinks about is work.

17:45.730 --> 17:47.330
You're right.

17:47.330 --> 17:53.320
I'm sure she'd panic or scowl just like us 
if she saw a mountain of proposals.

17:54.670 --> 17:57.580
Wouldn't she be more likely to panic?

17:57.940 --> 17:59.170
You're not wrong.

18:00.230 --> 18:03.270
What are you going to do?

18:05.060 --> 18:06.820
You may be the son of a margrave,

18:06.820 --> 18:09.430
but you'll lose her if you drag your feet.

18:14.160 --> 18:15.660
I know that.

18:18.370 --> 18:22.330
If you won't make a move, 
maybe I should instead.

18:24.240 --> 18:30.860
I'd rather step forward myself than let some 
good-for-nothings become potential suitors.

18:41.490 --> 18:43.310
Yes? Come in.

18:44.140 --> 18:46.270
The Japanese food is ready!

19:00.790 --> 19:02.370
This is amazing...

19:09.000 --> 19:11.460
No sneaking bites!

19:12.020 --> 19:13.420
Goodness!

19:16.410 --> 19:17.500
Sei!

19:17.950 --> 19:21.390
Aira! Thanks for coming.

19:21.390 --> 19:25.330
No, thank <i>you</i>. I'm so happy you invited me.

19:30.500 --> 19:33.690
I never thought I'd get
 Japanese food in this world...

19:36.110 --> 19:38.060
E-Er, pardon me.

19:38.060 --> 19:39.810
I know exactly how you feel.

19:44.080 --> 19:47.290
Rice is our food for the soul!

19:47.290 --> 19:48.930
Sei...

19:49.810 --> 19:50.930
Huh.

19:51.490 --> 19:55.080
So this is food from your homeland, is it?

19:57.950 --> 20:00.300
I've never seen anything like it.

20:00.300 --> 20:02.760
Well? What's it called?

20:02.760 --> 20:06.230
I wonder what kind of effects it has...

20:06.230 --> 20:09.380
Pretty please, tell me everything in detail!

20:14.960 --> 20:16.210
Albert.

20:16.210 --> 20:18.780
Brother! You came as well.

20:18.780 --> 20:21.530
Yes. Sei invited me.

20:28.970 --> 20:30.630
Also...

20:30.630 --> 20:34.340
I thought someone ought to come 
and keep <i>that</i> under control.

20:34.780 --> 20:36.800
Well? Well?!

20:57.460 --> 20:59.990
You'll lose her if you drag your feet.

21:01.580 --> 21:03.040
I know.

21:06.590 --> 21:08.180
Commander Hawke!

21:29.540 --> 21:33.030
Finally, I can report something 
to His Imperial Majesty.

21:34.740 --> 21:35.760
Come in.

21:36.200 --> 21:37.460
Excuse me.

21:40.100 --> 21:41.900
Sorry for calling you.

21:41.900 --> 21:42.860
Not at all.

21:44.680 --> 21:49.940
Please send this letter to His Imperial 
Majesty of Zaidera as quickly as possible.

21:49.940 --> 21:51.420
I understand.

21:51.420 --> 21:54.320
Are you not returning with us, Captain?

21:54.320 --> 21:56.790
I will stay in this land for some time.

21:57.920 --> 22:01.880
I must find the alchemist 
who created this potion.

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
Next Time

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
"The Ceremony"
